simple storage service
----------------------
    1) s3 is storage storage service in aws. we can store any type of data like videos, 
        images and audio in the form of obects and no need to mount to any service to access
        we can use the endpoint
    2) when we upload any object to s3 its having unique id ad URI
    3) s3 is global service we can access from any where


benfits of s3
------------
    1) s3 is secure to store data (because we have policies to manage access who can access
     who can not access)
    2) version control means we can maintain different versions for a single file
    3) s3 lifecycle
    4) 

use case
--------
    1) used for storing the application logs
    2) s3 is perfect to store backup
    3) static files like videos, images, audio and doc 
    4) use for storing the statefile


