Why is S3 secure?
    "S3 provides multiple layers of security. We can control access using IAM policies
    and bucket policies, prevent accidental public exposure using Block Public Access, encrypt data at
    rest using SSE-S3 or SSE-KMS and data in transit using HTTPS. We can also enable versioning and Object
    Lock to protect data from accidental deletion or modification, while CloudTrail provides 
    auditing of API activity. So S3 security follows a defense-in-depth approach."

